  "description": "Midweek Mover Rankings And a Stock Buy - 07 February 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>In this week’s Midweek Movers….in which we were delayed due to the Tariff scare and locking in some profits due to earnings and VIX direction…we reviewed and ranked 10 companies: AMD, Intel, Nike, Lulu, Kodak, Cal-Maine Foods, Constellation Energy, Catalyst Pharmaceuticals, Sea Limited, SSR Mining. Also shared a stock position I picked up this morning, due to it structurally being very similar to Palantir before it’s 25% pump. </p><p>We will hold the chart structure class on 16 February 2025 at 9 PM EST. Standby for a zoom link to come out in preparation for that. One final note…I notice some people grieving about “oh I could have made ___%” more. This is a good problem. More than 90% of people fail in the markets. The fact that you have made a sizeable gain…pat yourself on the back. Sometimes tickers continue running. Sometimes pumps happen with out you. Just stay steady and consistent in your strategy. You are doing great!</p><p>If you have questions, as always, I am available in the chat. As always, these are just my thoughts and opinions. You are responsible for yourself. Thanks for stopping by 👍</p><p>UPDATE: Please note that I used the “CALM APP” logo in the video. CALM is a review for Cal-Maine Foods. The analysis remains the same. </p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/picture-perfect-stocks?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Think someone else would like this investing content? Share it with someone you know!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/picture-perfect-stocks?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/picture-perfect-stocks?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
